1
00:00:00,900 --> 00:00:03,840
This is the whole build. Nothing hidden.

2
00:00:03,900 --> 00:00:06,858
A trigger reads the invoice sheet at seven.

3
00:00:07,400 --> 00:00:10,040
Anything due today gets pulled in.

4
00:00:10,600 --> 00:00:13,888
It matches the open invoice in the CRM.

5
00:00:14,000 --> 00:00:16,650
Then drafts a follow-up in your tone.

6
00:00:17,200 --> 00:00:19,741
You can read it. Or let it send.

7
00:00:20,400 --> 00:00:22,776
It sends from your own inbox.

8
00:00:23,400 --> 00:00:26,061
And logs the thread back to the sheet.

9
00:00:26,600 --> 00:00:29,130
Forty-seven invoices chased.

10
00:00:29,400 --> 00:00:31,704
A morning back, every week.

11
00:00:32,400 --> 00:00:34,200
Book a fit call.

12
00:00:35,600 --> 00:00:38,313
inodepi.github.io
